# HABITUX — Complete Full-Stack Application Build Prompt for Google AI Studio

## 1. Project Objective

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, UI/UX engineer, database architect, security engineer, and QA engineer.

Transform the existing **HABITUX visiting page** into a fully functional, production-oriented hostel discovery and enquiry platform for Indian students, interns, working professionals, and travellers.

The existing HTML visiting page is the **primary visual design reference**. Preserve its brand identity, section order, layout, typography, spacing, colors, content style, and responsive behavior wherever possible. Do not replace it with a generic template or redesign it from scratch.

Build the complete application with a real frontend, persistent database, authentication, authorization, file uploads, business logic, and working dashboards.

**This is not a static website task. It is a complete full-stack application task.**

### Core product goal

Habitux helps users discover suitable hostels and paying guest accommodations, compare actual costs and amenities, contact property owners, submit booking enquiries, and track responses.

Hostel owners can register, submit properties for review, manage listings, update room availability, and respond to enquiries. Administrators can review submitted properties, manage reported content, and maintain platform integrity.

Do not claim that a property, review, rating, verification, statistic, or availability status is genuine unless it is supported by actual stored data and the relevant verification process.

