## 3. Required Technology Stack

Use the following stack unless the existing AI Studio project already has a compatible implementation that should be preserved.

### Frontend

- React.
- TypeScript.
- Vite.
- Tailwind CSS or the existing styling system needed to reproduce the supplied design.
